      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَاذَةُ</span></b>  <i>The part that is in a state of commotion,</i>
[or <i>that pulses,</i>] <i>of the top of the head of a</i> [<i>young</i>]
<i>child;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَاذِيَةُ</span> [which belongs to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غذو</span>].
(IAar, K, TA.)

